title: The Factory Councils
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and factory_councils_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.factory_councils_timer = 3;
Q.month_actions += 1;
RG.target('militancy');
!}
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: movement

= The Factory Councils

[? if time < 14 : The councils of November are losing ground to the new republic, but the factory councils are still alive in the big plants. The government has promised to write them into law, and to tame them in the process. ?][? if time >= 14 : Since the Works Councils Act of February 1920, every large firm must have an elected works council. The law gives it the right to see the balance sheet and little else. ?]

[? if sys_target_striking = 0 : In **[+ sys_target_name +]** the councils are the most radical in the country. ?][? if sys_target_striking = 1 : In **[+ sys_target_name +]** the councils are already leading a strike. ?]

- @build: Win the council seats, works by works.
- @occupy: Have the councils of [+ sys_target_name +] occupy the works.
- @congress: Call a national congress of works councils.
- @easy_discard

@build
subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Slow gains, larger where the districts follow the Zentrale.
choose-if: lock_councils < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids council work.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_councils == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.worker_support += 2 + 5 * Q.loyal_share;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Communist shop stewards win seats on council after council.

@occupy
subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Red flags over the gates, and the whole district out with them. The police will come.
choose-if: lock_councils < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids council work.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_councils == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
if (Q.sys_target_striking == 0) {
    RG.startStrike(Q.sys_target);
}
RG.district(Q.sys_target, {militancy: 6, repression: 10});
if (!Q.ultraleft_gone) {
    Q.lean_ultraleft += 1;
} else {
    Q.lean_offensive += 1;
}
!}

The councils take over the works and post their own guards at the gates. The district stops work in sympathy.

@congress
subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Costs 1 fund. Councillors of every party meet under our banner, and the Independents come.
view-if: time >= 14
choose-if: lock_councils < 2 and resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if lock_councils = 2 : The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids council work. ?][? if resources < 1 : We have no funds. ?]
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_councils == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.uspd_relation += 8;
Q.worker_support += 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

Hundreds of works councillors meet in Berlin and elect a national committee with a communist majority. The union leaders told their members to stay away. Many did not.
